The witness guest for E6 (#1234) and #1264 (ADR 0122) — provenance, per ADR 0114's rule for committed guest
binaries. Like p3std and p3sleep, it is reproducible from this repository plus the pinned toolchain: p3cat/build.sh
rebuilds it offline, and generates its stdin.

